TEXT -96 392 Left 2 !.param Ccpl=10p
TEXT -96 424 Left 2 !.param Cres=32p
TEXT -96 456 Left 2 !.param Lval=82n
TEXT 320 392 Left 2 !* RX 2m BPF inductors: Coilcraft 0402HP 82nH (high-Q wirewound) replacing C167487 multilayer. Q~40 @146MHz assumed -- verify part value/Q on datasheet.
TEXT -80 792 Left 2 !.param Q=40
TEXT -80 816 Left 2 !.param RsL={2*3.14159265*146e6*Lval/Q}
TEXT -80 840 Left 2 !.param Cp=0.2p
TEXT -80 864 Left 2 !* --- FM band notches: TWO series L-C shunt zeros bracketing 88-108 MHz. f_notch1 = low edge, f_notch2 = high edge (a quasi-elliptic stopband). Kills FM across the band with ~no passband loss. Rn = width knob. Slide f_notch1/f_notch2 (and Rn) to flatten the stopband; watch the 88/98/108 meas. On the board, place antenna-side (before C1). ---
TEXT -80 888 Left 2 !.param f_notch1=91Meg
TEXT -80 912 Left 2 !.param f_notch2=106Meg
TEXT -80 936 Left 2 !.param Ln=100n
TEXT -80 960 Left 2 !.param Rn=5
TEXT -80 984 Left 2 !.param Cn1={1/(4*3.14159265*3.14159265*f_notch1*f_notch1*Ln)}
TEXT -80 1008 Left 2 !.param Cn2={1/(4*3.14159265*3.14159265*f_notch2*f_notch2*Ln)}
TEXT -80 1032 Left 2 !Lnotch1 out na {Ln} Rser={Rn}
TEXT -80 1056 Left 2 !Cnotch1 na 0 {Cn1}
TEXT -80 1080 Left 2 !Lnotch2 out nb {Ln} Rser={Rn}
TEXT -80 1104 Left 2 !Cnotch2 nb 0 {Cn2}
TEXT -96 712 Left 2 !.meas AC rej_fm88 FIND mag(2*V(out)) AT 88Meg
TEXT -96 744 Left 2 !.meas AC rej_fm108 FIND mag(2*V(out)) AT 108Meg
TEXT -96 776 Left 2 !.meas AC rej_fm98 FIND mag(2*V(out)) AT 98Meg
TEXT -96 488 Left 2 !.ac dec 2000 10Meg 1000Meg
TEXT -96 520 Left 2 !.meas AC S21_peak MAX mag(2*V(out))
TEXT -96 552 Left 2 !.meas AC f_center WHEN mag(2*V(out))=S21_peak
TEXT -96 584 Left 2 !.meas AC IL_146 FIND mag(2*V(out)) AT 145.9Meg
TEXT -96 616 Left 2 !.meas AC rej_fm FIND mag(2*V(out)) AT 100Meg
TEXT -96 648 Left 2 !.meas AC rej_lo2 FIND mag(2*V(out)) AT 291.8Meg
TEXT -96 680 Left 2 !.meas AC rej_tx FIND mag(2*V(out)) AT 437Meg
